From 9606cf508050843e7a7fce292ffc715e7f099b67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:41:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(2d): support Do not touch on 2D Pocket operations

Enable Do not touch protected faces and edges on 2D Pocket operations,
including all strategies, pre-drilled entries, corner reliefs, rest
machining, overhead clearance lifts up to clearance_z, and crossing-free
helix restarts between depth levels.

Stacked on #3353.
Fixes #3345
